flowchart LR
    upstream[Canonical upstream]
    bare[(Managed bare repository\nmanaged_repo_id)]
    refresh[refs/evander/refresh/...]
    agent[refs/heads/agents/session/topic]
    review[review and Team refs]
    operation[host-only operation ref]
    worktree[unique detached worktree]
    publish[leased upstream push]

    upstream -->|credentialed refresh| refresh
    refresh -->|atomic ref transaction| bare
    bare --> agent
    agent -->|pin exact commit| operation
    operation --> review
    operation --> worktree
    worktree -->|prepare or verify| operation
    operation -->|compare-and-swap| publish
    publish --> upstream

    guard[Guest writes are restricted to its exact agent namespace; host workflows publish only pinned SHAs.]
    guard --- agent
